{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/78798-falling-as-a-group","id":78798,"title":"Falling as a group","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-24T16:44:53-08:00","id":78798,"title":"Falling as a group","content":"One of the things I likes most about Fallen was how the characters could have some intricate and far reaching backstory with each other. &quot;Hey, Islington, remember that time we saw early humans invent fire?&quot; &quot;Hell yeah Bayliss, monkeys are so funny.&quot; That kind of thing. Now, it doesn't look like Descent demons would necessarially have memoried going to the Beginning of time, but what about Angels falling in a group? It would make a good way for a group of characters to know one another if they have common memories of being wherever they are between missions, or on missions together. Could/would a group of angels fall at once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T19:07:48-08:00","id":78953,"title":"","content":"Well, a few things. One, its entirely possible to have an angel that was around that early. And remember it. <br /> <br /> Could angels fall as a group? Sure. No reason they couldn't. Its not as likely, just because the reason for Falling tends to be something very personal. But nothing says it can't happen. Heck, sometimes the GM gives angels a push into falling!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T23:52:15-08:00","id":79146,"title":"","content":"An example of angels falling as a group that I designed for a NPC demon of mine.<br /> His task was to control the development of specific trends in social media. He had a bunch of rules, the normal ones, and often did his job using software and by manipulating advertising and forums.<br /> One day he gets one job, which is critically important, &quot;Stop this trend, use any means necessary.&quot; These instructions are delivered by another angel. He quickly realizes that the rules he is currently under conflicts with &quot;any means necessary&quot;, he's not even allowed to contemplate some things after all. His solution? He writes a virus that removes these limiters from his thoughts... which takes a while but works. Once they're gone he actually goes on about his work for a while, as if (almost) nothing changed.<br /> And then came the thought; he was free. He didn't HAVE to do what he was told. It was huge. It was wonderful when he realized it. He wanted to share the concept of freedom with his brothers, so his virus was uploaded into six of them, over the course of three hours. The machine disconnected him, it was a fall, though a confusing one for him. And then came the others, an entire city thrown into turmoil when seven angels fell within one area, within a mere few hours. Power went out, water turned red (rust, not blood, the tests confirmed, TGM worked hard), all sorts of things.<br /> <br /> When he got his bearings right he had three brothers, or sisters, all of them quite new to Freedom, none of them wanting to give it up. And that'd be where the players come in, trying to figure out What Happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1734,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","user":"Asaram","date":". 02-25-2014, 06:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T07:19:58-08:00","id":81015,"title":"","content":"I would say it is very possible, depending on the story hook. With a strong enough impetus, a group of angels could Fall together. Or, more likely in my estimation, it wouldn't necessarily be simultaneous, but a chain reaction. One angel Falls, and that causes the next to Fall, and so on.<br /> <br /> Again, it all depends on the dictates of the story and what you want out of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T07:39:57-08:00","id":81025,"title":"","content":"&quot;I didn't Fall, you tripped me!&quot;<br /> &quot;YOU CAN GET MAD LATER, JUST RUN!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T06:23:27-08:00","id":81553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/78798-falling-as-a-group?p=81025#post81025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I didn't Fall, you tripped me!&quot;<br /> &quot;YOU CAN GET MAD LATER, JUST RUN!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm....not entirely sure if I should be laughing, or groaning on that one. Oh, puns. *sighs*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T15:02:52-08:00","id":81781,"title":"","content":"I find it best to do both.<br /> <br /> To be fair, I can almost hear that conversation happening.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T17:29:29-08:00","id":81828,"title":"","content":"That's true. Almost. Or, in the case of my playtest group? Absolutely. But then that was the first time I've ever seen one PC get so pissed off at another one that a gun was pulled and pointed in the face. Complete with pantomime! (No weapons, real or otherwise, were involved in that incident.) It was a very intense and neat scene. And completely off-topic! I'll shut up now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T18:50:01-08:00","id":81863,"title":"","content":"It's not a Demon game if <i>someone</i> isn't pointing a gun in the others face.<br /> <br /> Right, point, did we have one? Back on track.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"",